      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu aMukwakutaŋisha, mwana kaDavidi mwanta wamuYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakutaŋisha nindi, Kuhemesha kwayuma yakuhemesha, kuhemesha kwayuma yakuhemesha, yonsu yakuhemesha hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwejima mwakabakanaŋayi muntu mwishina detaŋwa wamwenaŋamu yumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiŋu dawantu dimu hidikuya, ikiŋu di kwawu hidikuhiŋamu, iseki saŋa dashakamina haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itaŋwa nawa hidikutuntuka, itaŋwa hidikuhuma, hidikuya lufuchi kudatuntukilaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpepela hiyi kuya kukabeta kakuchidiilu, hiyikubalumukila kukabeta kakuchimunswa, hiyikubalumukaŋa munjila yayu mafuku ejima, mpepela hiyikufunta chiŋi kuyanyepumukilaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuloŋa twejima twasaŋaŋa mukaluŋalwiji, hela chochu, kalupalwŋi kwinzala nehi; kwayaloŋa tuloŋa kwokwakuyawu nawa cheŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yejima yazeyeshaŋa hohu, kutwesha kuchishimuna kudi muntu nehi; disu hidekutaŋa nakumonaku, itu hidenzalaŋa nakutiyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuma chekala dehi dichi chakekala nawa; chuma chelawu dehi dichi chakelawu; mwishina detaŋwa himwekala chuma chachihaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuduhu chuma chatenaŋawu antu, nawu, Talenu, ichi chachiha, tahindi? Chekalaku dehi kunyaka yásambilili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikudi kwanuka antu akunyaka yakusambilaku; hela antu akalondelamu hiyamba kaanukaŋa akayilondela wenaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami mukwakutaŋisha nadiŋi mwanta wawaIsarela muYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchima wami nashili kumudimu wakutalatala nakukeŋakeŋa nama ana mwaya yuma yejima yakoŋaŋawu mwishina dewulu; komana himudimu wakala wanenkiyi Nzambi anyana kawantu kulonda akadikabishi nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoni dehi nyidimu yejima yakoŋaŋawu mwishina detaŋwa; komana yejima yakuhemesha hohu, komana hikukabila tuhu mpepela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaheŋa dehi kutwesha kucholola nehi, yinabulumu kutwesha kuyichinda nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahosheli mumuchima wami nami, Tala, ami naheta dehi maana amavulu akubadika antu ejima ásambilili muYerusalema. Mwalala, muchima wami wamona dehi nankashi niyamaana niyakwiluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashili muchima wami kumudimu wakwiluka maana, niiluki nawa nikwimika disu niwusupi. Niiluka nikwiluka nami, Komana hikukabila tuhu mpepela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa muma ana amavulu mwekala chikela chachivulu, niwavulishaŋa maana wavulishaŋa yihuŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
